# What this project is responsible for, and what happens when it breaks.
level: 1
owner: Eli Ferres
monitor: GitHub Actions on every push
rollback: git revert and re-tag
migrations: n/a: the only state is transcript copies, rebuilt from the Codex log on demand
backups: n/a: transcript copies are disposable and pruned after 30 days
authz: the bridge is an enforcement point: it decides allow or refuse on each Codex call by running the configured hooks; tests cover every refusal path
